    "chunk_text": "ilde XII or. Gif preost on unriht ut of scire had begite, gilde XII or, & diacon VI or; & \u00feolian his hades, buton Gif preost on unhalgodon huse m\u00e6ssige, gilde XII or. Gif preost buton gehalgedon weofode m\u00e6ssige, gilde XII or. Gif preost on treowenan calice husl gehalgige, XII or. Gif preost buton wine m\u00e6ssige, gilde XII or. Gif preost husl forgime, gilde XII or. Gif preost anes d\u00e6ges m\u00e6ssige oftor \u00feonne \u00f0riwa, gilde XII or. Gif man ciricgri\u00f0 abrece, bete be circan m\u00e6\u00f0e & be \u00feam \u00fee hire mund sy. Gif man mid cirican mangie, bete be lahslite. Gif man cirican nyd\u00feeowige, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t be lahslihte. Gif man preost of circan on unriht utige, bete \u00fe\u00e6t be lahslite. Gif man preost gewundige, gebete man \u00fea wyndlan & biscope to weofodbote for his hade sille XII or; Gif man preost ofslea, forgilde man hine be fullan were & biscope feower & XX or to weofodbote; \u00e6t Gif preost circan miswur\u00f0ige, \u00fee eal his wur\u00f0scipe of sceal arisan, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t. Gif preost on circan ungedafenlice \u00feingc gelogige, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t. Gif preost ciric\u00feingc utige, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t. Gif preost silfwilles \u00fea circan forl\u00e6te, \u00f0e he to gehadod w\u00e6s, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t. Gif preost o\u00f0erne forseo o\u00f0\u00f0e gebismrige mid worde o\u00f0\u00f0e mid weorce, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t. Gif preost wi\u00f0 o\u00f0erne gefeohte, bete him",
